Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the\Nsea Raising our voices We
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,take in the beautiful blue\Nworld Our spirits ready to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,go Everybody rejoices Now\Nlet's go get the sails all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for adventure. We're\Nitching to try. Get ready to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,roam So all aboard now We're\Nset to go Set sail to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,ocean so deep Ready for a\Ntruly grand adventure Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think That sounds really\Nfun All this excitement Second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to none As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our voices We take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,in the beautiful blue world Our\Nspirits ready to go Everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,rejoices Now let's go get the sales
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah If there's something\Nthat I just won't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,ever forget. It's the way that I felt when
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,our journey was set Now\NI won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,cause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is a dream, I\Ndon't want to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking a hot bath while the\Nwaves gently rock the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An office.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my very own doctor's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught a cool shark!\NPut it in! Put it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it in the fish\Ntank! Ha ha ha ha! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right in you! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we have a new guest, a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this room perfect or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The room's fine, but don't those\Nidiots know a shark's a bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the fish are gonna love this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see the shark yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the one with the big horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's an impressive specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it doesn't seem\Nto play very well with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.14,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you think was gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how the food\Nchain works, you idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat you for doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, turn this bastard\Ninto a barbecue dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't barbecue everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fresh fish we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be sushi, or we could boil\Nit and add some spicy vinegar Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even sharp to the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.94,0:03:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's something\Nfloating in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it? There.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it says treasure on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you fell off a treasure ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it up and see what's inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's gonna be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.55,0:04:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably just some old\Nbooze and preserved food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it says a treasure\Noffering to the sea gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old practice\Ncalled barrel drifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,People pray for safe passage by making an
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,offering to the guardian\Nspirits of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's more about superstition\Nthan actual treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words we got our hopes up over\Na barrel of sea trash whoa who says booze
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is trash let's drink it what no that's\Nbad karma you'll be fine just say a little
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,prayer first i pray to know god sea or\Notherwise alcohol stirred by the waves from
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,what i hear that improves\Nthe taste oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,let's find out all right then we'll make a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,toast after you finish they say that you're\Nsupposed to add a new offering and set
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It adrift again for good luck. Okay, who
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,cares open up so hey\Ngod we're stealing your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,booze now you're praying to god if i\Nremember you beat the crap out of god back on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Skypiea don't bother. God's\Na jerk. Prayer's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,here goes okay let me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,see whoa what is that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is bright, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The booze flew in the\Nair, and then it blew up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a signal flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess the sea god didn't like\Nyou messing with his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.48,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It could just be a prank, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.46,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But if it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we've alerted someone, and\Nthey're about to come looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the booze was a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, even worse, it was a trap, and\Nwe set it off by opening the barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what kind of horrible\Npeople are going to come after us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Something isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the air pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds are moving fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking all over the\Nplace, but I don't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to escape south by southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge storm is coming in five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything, but\Nif you say it's coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your word for it\Nsince you're the navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's our heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Two o 'clock, straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting straight headwinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's gonna overturn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the sun can handle this.\NYou know the trick. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, raise the\Nsails! It's paddle time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I like the sound of that! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier, dock system, channel zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hula engines, paddle ship, study!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it yeah it's nice we got out of the\Nstorm and all but where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be night yet right so why\Nis it so dark and what's with this fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,strange huh This is it\Nwe paddled the sunny
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,straight into that sea\Nkokoro was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, I wasn't ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're at Fishman Island already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the sea of ghosts
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've heard of the\NFlower Triangle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's also called\Nthe Devil's Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Haunted sea where ships are swallowed\Nby the darkness without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On the ghost, I can't wait. Shut\Nup. Why does everyone know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,this except me if this is some\Nkind of prank it's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah it's real and I\Nhear there's zombies and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,skeletons too why are\Nyou happy about this loop
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're letting your imagination\Nrun wild. Stop trying to scare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen Usopp the truth of the\Nmatter is every year over a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,hundred ships vanish in these\Nwaters without any explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the sailor's souls stay on the\Nships, wandering for all eternity. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you warn me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we had, there's\Nnothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cover myself in\Nanti-ghost stuff! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta let me borrow stuff too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the song of the jam! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.92,0:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be cursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you talk back to the ghost then\Nyou'll be pulled into the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't answer them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what they say to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll steal your soul and\Nbind them to the ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone actually riding this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can you cut ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,On the deck, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Garden rumble of the crew. It's\Ntime to ship out. Binks' brew
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to be me of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a recount.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I said I would go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd go sailing off with a bunch of\Nskeletons, and we'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have made Usopp go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-Swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sweet prince is here to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You were all excited about\Nfinding a treasure ship before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way in hell\Nthis is a treasure ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got singing skeletons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe he's the one guarding\Nall the awesome treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Evil makes me gone! Out with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Luffy rest in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, good afternoon, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for stopping by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You must excuse me for not\Ngreeting you properly before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I really was quite surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so many years, you see,\Nwandering these waters all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so used to ghost ships\Nthat humans frightened me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite ironic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but please come\Ninside and take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have many tales to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a singing, talking Afro-skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What a charming young\Nwoman you are. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all eyes for ladies like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I would be if skeletons had any eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you perhaps show me\Nyour panties? Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Feisty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt me right down to the bone,\Nbecause I'm a skeleton, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That kick just gave him\Nswelling on his skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, do skeletons poop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got like a million questions to\Nask before that one! Oh, yes. I poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever heard of TMI?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to hear that! Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,how is it that you can sing and talk\Nlike that when you're nothing but bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really the living dead or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the hell happened to this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,These waters aren't\Nreally haunted, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We need answers. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I got one for you. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you join our crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.18,0:14:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello and good day to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As of today, I will be joining you on\Nthis ship as your newest crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Once dead and all bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,my name is Brooke and i\Ndo hope we can get along
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,are you kidding me what the\Nheck is this thing oh my
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,what a tough crowd you are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,please don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,haunt me my
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,goodness and what a lovely\Nyoung woman perhaps you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,would like to show me\Nyour panties that's enough
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,sexual harassment damn it\Nthere's no way a walking
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,talking afro-sporting\Nskeleton could exist this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,must be a dream we just need\Nto wake up oh it's a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,literally that's nice uh excuse me\Nwhat is this thing and why is it on our
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ship that's our new crew member isn't\Nhe funny who cares he's not joining
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,our crew this is exactly why i want you\Nto go with him what the hell happened
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,were you just picking your noses while\Nhe brought a skeleton back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship. I know we messed up. Now. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,let's be civil everyone why don't we go
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,inside you can treat me to dinner you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,don't get to decide that what a spacious
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,dining room you've got and such a splendid\Nkitchen a magnificent ship if i've
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever seen one? Yep, of course it is.\NIt's the most super ship I've ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Those sockets look empty, but\Nyou got a good eye for quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, don't get friendly\Nwith the skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of quality, I can't\Nwait to try out your cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I was stuck on\Nthat dreary ghost ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been decades since\NI've eaten a proper meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought my stomach\Nshrink and shrink until
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even tell the back of my belly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,from the front of my back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the sort of miserable life I led.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, that's saying a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,seeing as skeletons don't even\Nhave a proper back or stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a skull joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a skull joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me say, I am quite the gentleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so I am well-versed in the art\Nof patiently waiting for my food,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how long it takes. Yeah! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear boy, can I have a glass of milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good for the bones, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, or I'm gonna smash your skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.54,0:16:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but my name is Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is rude, But I don't\Nbelieve I ever caught your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So anyway, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You invited him to join the crew\Nand you just now ask him that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finish interrogating\Nthe skeleton later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:17:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, let's put all those\Noctopi you caught to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat all of\Nthis you want, Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's cooking is the\Nbest of the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, my stomach is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my heart has already been filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but notice that\Nyour portion is a bit large.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.10,0:17:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be interested\Nin switching with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The revive, revive fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was a Devil Fruit after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a complicated tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth of the matter is, I actually\Ndid die already many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you clean off your damn face?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a messy eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The revive, revive fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,allows a person to be\Nreanimated after they have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Even among Devil Fruit powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the ability to live two lives\Nis indeed quite strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a revive man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're not immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like you died once and it\Ngave you a second chance at life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, yes. Ah, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But during my first life, if you\Nwill, I was a pirate, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to beat some\Nmanners into you if I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,have to break every\Nsingle one of your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sailing with the rest of my\Ncrew through these accursed waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, for the record, I had flesh and\Nblood like anyone else back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we had the misfortune of\Nrunning afoul of a very powerful adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the entire crew met its demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course that included me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was alive the revive revive fruit\Ndid precious little other than rob me of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:19:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,my ability To swim but on that fateful\Nday its true power awakened as I lay dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirit returned from\Nthe netherworld and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,came to unite with this\Nbody of mine once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.08,0:19:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if it had actually found my body as\Nintended that would all be well and good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But as you can see the fog around here is\Nquite thick so the matter became a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, poor little Soulbrook\Ncouldn't find his way back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All in all, my spirit wandered\Nthrough the foggy waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,searching for my body for an entire year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, at the end of its tragic journey,\Nthe two were reunited once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Much to my soul's dismay,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,by the time it found my body, there was\Nnothing left but a miserable pile of bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so shocked my eyes were\Nas wide as dinner plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I have eyes to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.68,0:20:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You got lost, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're stupid just like Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And so a walking, talking\Nskeleton was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, those Devil Fruit powers\Ncan be pretty scary sometimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you're just bones, it\Nstill brought you back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it only does it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the fact that he still\Ncan't swim and he's stuck like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of like a\Ncrappy deal if you ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeletons aren't supposed\Nto have hair, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially not so much of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Afro a wig or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my roots are just very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that means you're not\Nactually a ghost after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a normal human like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, normal is a\Nstretch, I suppose, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The important thing is that\Nyou're definitely not a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, heavens no, I hate ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I saw one, I'd scream\Nmy lungs out if I had any!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.84,0:20:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a skeleton and\Nyou're afraid of ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you tried looking\Nin the mirror lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No mirrors!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.36,0:20:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:20:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show up in the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even have a shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of creature are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take a tea break you better explain
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself right away\Nmister I suppose that I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,should tell you the\Nrest of the story about
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened while I was drifting in this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,evil sea and the second tragedy I was forced\Nto face what I told you about becoming
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a skeleton is true but the reason I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,have a shadow is a\Ndifferent matter entirely
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now my shadow was stolen someone took it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:22:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,from me several years ago stolen but how\NI guess that's not any more ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,than a talking skeleton but it's still\Nhard to swallow can something like that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,really happen yes I'm afraid it can and in
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,addition to losing my reflection having my
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow stolen means I can no longer exist\Nin the world of light if even a ray of
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,sunlight touched this body every inch that\Nit fell upon would be reduced to naught
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but ash
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,saw
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,someone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.83,0:22:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,with the same curse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,as me lose his mind and run into the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,sunlight when at last his screams went\Nsilent nothing was left but a pile of dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.12,0:22:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so frightful, I swear my soul\Npractically left my body a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And just as the sunlight\Ndoes not cast my shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,my image cannot be reflected in a\Nmirror or captured in a photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:22:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You must forgive me for startling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but I hope you can understand my\Nreluctance to share this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.26,0:23:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For as you see, not only have\Nall of my comrades been slain,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I also live in a world without light.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hate to say it, but\Nyour life sure does suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.08,0:23:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, right now,\NI'm so happy to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A fluffy afro, a big smile, the\Ncheery gentleman skeleton, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.68,0:23:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does all this optimism come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.58,0:23:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's flipping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.80,0:23:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful day this has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I met other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Buried in a heavy fog,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I knew decades had passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.74,0:23:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell when one\Nday ended and another began.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.94,0:23:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unable to navigate or steer the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.46,0:23:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My companions long since dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I could only drift aimlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And so I waited and waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:24:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As the waves rocked me back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even imagine how\Nlonely I was all those years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.40,0:24:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just lonely, but scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.96,0:24:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanting to die every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.86,0:24:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, a long life is\Na blessing, not a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made me so happy meeting such\Nwonderful people gives my life meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had but the eyes to shed them,\NI would be crying tears of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.26,0:24:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now I was happy beyond measure\Nwhen you asked me to join your
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,crew and I sincerely want to thank\Nyou from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.96,0:24:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,However I fear that I must\Ndecline your offer. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.82,0:24:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned to all of you just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.98,0:24:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow has been stolen from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and I am unable to come in\Ncontact with any sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.74,0:24:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lonely though I may be, for\Nnow I am able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.44,0:24:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the thick fog\Ncovering these seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.80,0:24:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if I were to go on a journey with\Nyou, it would only be a matter of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,before I met my unfortunate demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.11,0:25:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,however unlikely it may be, I'll wait for\Nthe day when my shadow can be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.02,0:25:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no bones about it. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.74,0:25:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear you\Nmake excuses like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.22,0:25:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need your shadow back so\Nbad, then we'll get it back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.60,0:25:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You said someone stole it from you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.74,0:25:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.66,0:25:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can we find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.90,0:25:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.08,0:25:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are a kind person, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.66,0:25:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But for that reason, I'm\Nafraid that I cannot tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We've only just met, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.82,0:25:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I cannot ask you\Nto throw your life away
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.76,0:25:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,attempting something\Nthat's nearly impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the guy's tough and\Nall, but give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.46,0:25:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Least you can do is tell us his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's best that I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.40,0:25:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I doubt I could find him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have decided that when\Nand if I do ever reach him,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.14,0:25:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight him to\Nthe death of my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.50,0:25:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when my second life will end,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.98,0:25:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but I am willing to wait for\Nhim for the rest of my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:25:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.14,0:25:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I play a song for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am skilled with a great\Nmany instruments, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.66,0:26:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When I sailed the seas with my\Nold crew, I was their musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.51,0:26:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our crew needs a musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and join us already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.34,0:26:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.02,0:26:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't played music for\Nanyone in years, but here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.82,0:26:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.10,0:26:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.78,0:26:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.74,0:26:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.88,0:26:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.90,0:26:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.81,0:26:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening\Nto the ship It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.56,0:26:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A terrible fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.66,0:26:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have been watching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only thing that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.52,0:26:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone look to the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.90,0:26:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That noise we heard was\Nthis gate slamming shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.86,0:27:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our passage has already been blocked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems this is the backside\Nof the gate. That bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.18,0:27:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is very bad
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to the rear of the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.82,0:27:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.62,0:27:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.98,0:27:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you by any chance pick up a barrel\Nfrom the waters on your way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.48,0:27:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did. It was a trap.\NYou're all in great danger. Simply
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.46,0:27:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,put your ship's been targeted\Never since you came here you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.52,0:27:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,mean there's someone out there\Nhunting us down and by the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.12,0:27:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,way how'd we run into that gate\Nwhen our ship's not moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.40,0:27:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the heck did that\Ncreepy island come from this
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.78,0:27:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,is the ghost island that\Nwanders throughout these seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.18,0:28:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They call it Thriller Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.70,0:28:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.28,0:28:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The lock pose isn't reacting\Nto this island at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.86,0:28:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor should it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.96,0:28:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,because originally this island came\Nall the way in from the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, this has been a\Nfortunate day for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.90,0:28:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only was I able to meet you, but\Nnow my wish has been granted as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a hell of a jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.52,0:28:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's no pesky\Nflesh weighing me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.98,0:28:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do not follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must break through that gate\Nbehind you and escape this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, you cannot\Ndrop your anchor in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.42,0:28:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That being said, it truly was a\Npleasure meeting all of you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.38,0:28:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget your\Nkindness so long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.22,0:28:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.13,0:28:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we meet again on the high seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.68,0:28:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:28:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he a Devil Fruit user?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:29:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he's gonna sink like a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running on the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.38,0:29:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That is too cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.00,0:29:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, anyway, Luffy, we should\Nlisten to him and get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.80,0:29:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand the situation\Nhere, but I do know this island is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.50,0:29:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.41,0:29:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.52,0:29:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He totally wants to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
